I immediately hear a sound on my phone.
It is from my email app.
I open that email.
The new code is in it.
I usually get messages quickly on email.
I copy that code.
Then I open the telecom website again.
There is a new instruction on the screen.
"Please enter the new code."
I enter that code there.
I complete the form and press the button.
Immediately, a green mark comes on the screen.
Along with it, a notification also shows.
"Your account details are successfully updated."
I smile with relief.
I usually put off such things.
But now this work is finished.
It is still raining heavily outside.
I drink the rest of my coffee.
